  abilityName: Quick Strike EX
  abilityDesc: 19 combo powerful Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP, enormously boosts own critical hit rate), 30 combo massive random Water attack
    on all foes, adds probable great 1 turn Atk, Def reduction effect to attack for
    3 turns, critical and elemental vulnerability infliction for 2 turns, enormously
    boosts Water elemental damage for 3 turns & adds probable random status ailment
    infliction to attack for 3 turns
